    {
      "en": "scene mall1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/BGs/Mall1.png",
      "alt": "mall1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I show up at the mall around the same time I always do and immediately take note of Chika not being on what I will now just refer to as our bench.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Being an adult who's able to pick up on context clues, I understand that her absence means she’s working right now and I begin to ponder over whether or not today is the day I have been waiting for.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "It's been a while since Chika has modeled anything for me and we've definitely grown closer since then. So either we're at the lingerie stage now or we will be soon.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Either way, I must do my duty and find out.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whyissheadog1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/whyissheadog1.webp",
      "alt": "whyissheadog1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Chika, are you around? I was thinking that today we-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whyissheadog2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/whyissheadog2.webp",
      "alt": "whyissheadog2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "???",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "???",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "???",
      "spkColor": "#e6e6e6",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay, nevermind. I’ll come back later.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Not knowing how to handle the situation I have somehow found myself in, I immediately turn around and head for the door.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Of course, the small hand of the strange...helmeted figure reaches out and grabs my wrist.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Her grip obviously isn’t strong enough to prevent me from leaving since she is only a fraction of my size...but I’m pretty sure I know who this is anyway and that there isn't any real reason to run.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whyissheadog2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/whyissheadog2.webp",
      "alt": "whyissheadog2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Woof!",
      "spk": "Chinami (Dog Form)",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Hello, Chinami.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Woof!",
      "spk": "Chinami (Dog Form)",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Would you mind explaining to me why you’re dressed like that? And...out in public?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Big sis made Chinami put on her special mall clothes so she could be safe at work!",
      "spk": "Chinami (Dog Form)",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re not...covering your sister’s shift, are you? Because I don't think you're old enough to work here.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Chinami is a 5,000 year old wizard! She is more than old enough to work!",
      "spk": "Chinami (Dog Form)",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But no! Chinami didn’t want to be alone today and big-sis Yumi couldn’t come over.",
      "spk": "Chinami (Dog Form)",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yeah, you’re probably better off without Yumi anyway.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Woof!",
      "spk": "Chinami (Dog Form)",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Chinami, would you mind telling me where your sister is?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m coming! Hold on one sec!",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Chinami (Dog Form)",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "This stare-down is making me incredibly uncomfortable.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Chinami, go be a good girl and go...organize the underwear or something.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay! But Chinami needs to be sure she'll be fairly compensated!",
      "spk": "Chinami (Dog Form)",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whyissheadog1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/whyissheadog1.webp",
      "alt": "whyissheadog1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "What exactly would be fair compensation for child labor?...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whyissheadog3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/whyissheadog3.webp",
      "alt": "whyissheadog3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That kid, I swear.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She’s not a kid. She’s an ancient wizard. Be careful.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whyissheadog4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/whyissheadog4.webp",
      "alt": "whyissheadog4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Right, right. My bad.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whyissheadog5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/whyissheadog5.webp",
      "alt": "whyissheadog5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": So, whatcha up to today, Sensei? Come to spend some time with your favorite student?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It certainly appears that way.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, sorry to break your heart, but I’m kinda slammed right now. I’ve even resorted to having Chinami help since I can't handle all of this on my own.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m pretty sure that's against the law, but whatever.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean, it at least got her out of my hair for a little while...but you're right. I should probably figure something else out instead.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It's just kinda hard since I can't really afford a-",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whyissheadog6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/whyissheadog6.webp",
      "alt": "whyissheadog6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait a second...",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please, no.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I just got like, a totally awesome idea.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No you didn't.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Do you think that maybe you could watch her?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whyissheadog7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/whyissheadog7.webp",
      "alt": "whyissheadog7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Pleeeeeeease, Sensei? I’ll make it up to youuuuu~",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don't know. Is there anything you want? What if I like, buy you lunch or something?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I demand an expedited lingerie modeling session.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re still going on about that? That was like, forever ago.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There are some promises you can’t back down from, Chika.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This is a weird time to start dropping inspirational quotes.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It's also a weird time for me to become a babysitter.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whyissheadog8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/whyissheadog8.webp",
      "alt": "whyissheadog8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How about this! Either you watch my sister or I call security and tell them some old guy is harassing me.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This is blackmail.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I guess maybe it is a little, yeah.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’ve been hanging out with Yumi too much.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whyissheadog9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/whyissheadog9.webp",
      "alt": "whyissheadog9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Kinda unavoidable when we sleep in the same room.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Fine. I’ll do it. You’re going to have to explain the dog thing, though.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whyissheadog8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/whyissheadog8.webp",
      "alt": "whyissheadog8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m sure it’s not far off from whatever you're thinking.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Chinami doesn’t like wearing face-masks because they make her look funny. But, for some reason, she’s totally cool with a giant dog helmet.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And she has to wear gloves to prevent herself from touching anything with germs. And the scarf thingy-",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whyissheadog3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/whyissheadog3.webp",
      "alt": "whyissheadog3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well...that I don’t really have an answer for. I think she just likes it.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whyissheadog9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/whyissheadog9.webp",
      "alt": "whyissheadog9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She’s still super cute, though, right? And the way she’s all like “woof!” Oh my god. I wanna die.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You might want to keep an eye on her in case she walks up to any other customers, though.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whyissheadog6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/whyissheadog6.webp",
      "alt": "whyissheadog6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Who, Chinami? She wouldn’t do something like that. She never talks to strangers.",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you sure about that?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Mhm. Why do you ask?",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Because she’s trying to pet a customer’s dog right now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whyissheadog10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/whyissheadog10.webp",
      "alt": "whyissheadog10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What?! Chinami! Stop that right now!",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just because you're in dog form doesn't mean you can play with...other dogs!",
      "spk": "Chika",
      "spkColor": "#AF7F00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene black",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Misc/black.png",
      "alt": "black"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Chika runs over and snatches her sister away right before she comes into contact with a small dog hanging out of a wealthy-looking woman’s purse.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Feeling the need to get her out of here in order to avoid any other possible issues, Chika pawns Chinami off on me and sends the two of us out to go...walk around the mall or something.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ".........",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "......",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whyissheadog11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/whyissheadog11.webp",
      "alt": "whyissheadog11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What has my life become?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Woof!",
      "spk": "Chinami (Dog Form)",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Chinami’s tiny hands wrap around mine as the two of us walk through the mall.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I’m sure everyone around thinks she’s my daughter-",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Or...at least, I hope everyone around thinks she’s my daughter. It would be extremely problematic for them to think anything else at this point.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I'm sure the dog mask isn’t doing us any favors, either.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you going to be Chinami’s new daddy?",
      "spk": "Chinami (Dog Form)",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene whyissheadog12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/whyissheadog12.webp",
      "alt": "whyissheadog12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Chinami (Dog Form)",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why not? You and my big sister are in love, aren’t you?",
      "spk": "Chinami (Dog Form)",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re not?",
      "spk": "Chinami (Dog Form)",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No, Chinami. I’m just her teacher.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Chinami doesn’t know much about teachers since Chinami is home-schooled. Do all teachers visit you at work?",
      "spk": "Chinami (Dog Form)",
      "spkColor": "#FF9999",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
